      "content": "it's not just about finding courage. that's the thing. there is no \"breaking through.\" the system is built to keep us in this exact spot. everything feels so scripted and hollow. i just look at the city and all i see is a machine that's slowly grinding me down to nothing. is there even a version of this where things actually change? or is it just... meant to be this way?",
